usage: publisher.py [-h] --preparation-sha256 PREPARATION_SHA256
                    [--contract CONTRACT] [--parent-start PARENT_START]
                    [--parent-exit PARENT_EXIT] [--output OUTPUT]
                    [--contract-sha256 CONTRACT_SHA256]
                    [--parent-start-sha256 PARENT_START_SHA256]
                    [--parent-exit-sha256 PARENT_EXIT_SHA256]
                    [--root-authorized-publish]
                    {status,publish}

Source-only formal-pair publisher draft; no future evidence is manufactured.
All scientific/parent/container gates belong to the reviewed admission module.
The existing publisher supplies pure readers, reference metadata and
rendering; its old single-controller receipt schema is never synthesized or
bypassed. This file has not been imported or invoked. Actual
publication/recovery/browser checks still need future model/contract/evidence
and separate operator review.

positional arguments:
  {status,publish}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --preparation-sha256 PREPARATION_SHA256
  --contract CONTRACT
  --parent-start PARENT_START
  --parent-exit PARENT_EXIT
  --output OUTPUT
  --contract-sha256 CONTRACT_SHA256
  --parent-start-sha256 PARENT_START_SHA256
  --parent-exit-sha256 PARENT_EXIT_SHA256
  --root-authorized-publish
